ola Grey Shepherd. Little baby Zola was adopted by the series' leading lovebirds, Dr. Meredith Grey and Dr. Derek Shepherd. Zola was just a six ... \",\"title\":\"https://adoptionswithlove.org/uncategorized/adoption-on-television\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"bf2ff768d6d0dd1c17cac867ef9c5204db0058e7f5ad6c7301fc36045dd5de84\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0fada3bddb534659e219e3015d8c28c772e1e4e0351a55e9d54fc2c1d0d44d03\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Grey's Anatomy Meredith Derek married children died\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_86c482e333e64fa89e8cccc8"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d172\"},\"ref\":\"d172\",\"snippet\":\" ... On the Job\\n\\n- Pleading Guilty\\n\\n- Red Bull Big Time\\n\\n- Rock the Route\\n\\n- Shameless\\n\\n- So You Think You Can Dance\\n\\n- SuperNanny\\n\\n- The Glade\\n\\n- The Line\\n\\n- The Oprah Winfrey Show\\n\\n- Top Chef\\n\\n- Yard Crashers\\n\\n2009\\n\\n- Access Hollywood\\n\\n- Adventures of an Incurable Optimist\\n\\n- American Masters: The Day Carl Sandburg Died\\n\\n- America ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.chicago.gov/city/en/depts/dca/supp_info/chicago_film_office7.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d173\"},\"ref\":\"d173\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2003, Mulroney played Gavin Mitchell on the TV series Friends. He appeared in three episodes of the ninth season, his character briefly dating Rachel. This would mark Mulroney's last on-screen appearance on television for a number of years, later revealing in a May 2007 interview ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d174\"},\"ref\":\"d174\",\"snippet\":\" ... List of Shameless (American TV series) characters - Wikipedia\\ndate: 2014-03-23\\n---\\nname: Frank Gallagher\\nseries: Shameless (U.S.)\\ncreator: Paul Abbott\\nportrayer: William H. Macy Jacob DeMonte-Finn (young Frank)\\nfull_name: Francis Gallagher\\nspouse: Monica Gallagher (ex-wife)\\nchildren: * Fiona Gallagher (Daughter), * Lip Gallagher (Son), * Ian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Shameless_(American_TV_series)_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d106\"},\"ref\":\"d106\",\"snippet\":\" ... He continued acting in countless films and TV series until his death. Caan is survived by five children and four grandchildren.\\n\\nBrett Tuggle\\n\\nThe renowned veteran musician and celebrated keyboardist died on June 19, after a battle with cancer. He was 70. The news of his death was ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.etonline.com/gallery/stars-weve-lost-in-2022-177426\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d175\"},\"ref\":\"d175\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is survived by his wife Kelly Rizzo and his three children.\\n\\nDwayne Hickman\\n\\nDwayne Hickman, the TV executive and actor best known for his role as girl-infatuated teen Dobie Gillis in the CBS sitcom The Many Loves of Dobie Gillis, died on Jan. 9 from complications ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/celebrity/stars-we-lost-in-2022/?srsltid=AfmBOoqgtseDJPvB8Bamfe3oZlhWJZaiC5kf4fxP0pjffkBximQEpPNy\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"f53becc7ab0303eeefaf35b66f60a75fd611530bd3572e5874612bbbed910811\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0e816cb4ad00bb1f3c139c2c8e532690b1f9d19b7884a460b838fde857aab13e\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless TV series character married three times children died one survives\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d176\"},\"ref\":\"d176\",\"snippet\":\" ... Seinfeld (1989)\\n\\nThe biggest sitcom of the 1990s, Seinfeld takes its name from the star of the show, Jerry Seinfeld. Unlike Newhart, however, Seinfeld's character shares his name, and the show about nothing is also a show about a fictional Jerry Seinfeld played by the real Jerry ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.theshot.com/television/best-tv-shows-one-word-title\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d173\"},\"ref\":\"d173\",\"snippet\":\" ... He also appeared in the hit Showtime series Shameless as Sean, a recovering drug addict who runs a restaurant. In 2023, Mulroney starred in the sixth installment of the Scream franchise and starred in the Marvel Cinematic Universe television series Secret Invasion.\\n\\nPersonal life\\n\\nMulroney married actress Catherine ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dermot_Mulroney\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[{\"end\":3000,\"ref\":\"e1\",\"start\":0}],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d17\"},\"ref\":\"d17\",\"snippet\":\" ... are siblings in real life are commonly cast to play siblings on television. After all, that's the best way to make it seem like the relationship is an authentic one. In the case of Jessica and Richard Harmon, though, the siblings actually play unrelated characters in the ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/cw-stars-family/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d177\"},\"ref\":\"d177\",\"snippet\":\" ... The tiny spell caster uses a familiar to observe the environment and cast touch spells.\\n\\nI kinda like the idea of a tiny warforged character. Warforged Battle Master, 2 feet tall.\\n\\nNot siblings, but always a fun combo: Backpack wizard. One big strong character, like a war forged ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.dndbeyond.com/forums/dungeons-dragons-discussion/tips-tactics/36735-character-duos?srsltid=AfmBOop3vXaEoRyu1ZjIyRUKAByvf7jiyphXEFJc0GyL52Vd5p3pmTGG\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d178\"},\"ref\":\"d178\",\"snippet\":\" ... 90. \\\"Daphne's Room,\\\" Frasier (1995)\\n\\nJust as we seem to be losing privacy in real life, sitcom characters seem to have run of hiding places. Also mentioned: \\\"Archie Goes Too Far,\\\" All in the Family, \\\"Bargain Day,\\\" The Andy Griffith Show, and \\\"Ain't Nobody's Business ... \",\"title\":\"https://robertdavidsullivan.typepad.com/my_weblog/top-100-sitcom-episodes-of-all-time-the-list-so-far.html\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"3972120593bf9a85ae77e36783de45ee464bab11df8bac476bc227f9ac5d928e\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"adf53e2dbc4d351a5d5dc482833a20efae35aa57491bef6144776a4bb3e12dd0\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless cast real life couple siblings co-stars unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d174\"},\"ref\":\"d174\",\"snippet\":\" ... Frank Gallagher\\nseries: Shameless (U.S.)\\ncreator: Paul Abbott\\nportrayer: William H. Macy Jacob DeMonte-Finn (young Frank)\\nfull_name: Francis Gallagher\\nspouse: Monica Gallagher (ex-wife)\\nchildren: * Fiona Gallagher (Daughter), * Lip Gallagher (Son), * Ian Gallagher (Son), * Debbie Gallagher (Daughter), * Carl Gallagher (Son), * Liam Gallagher (Son), * Sammi Slott ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_Shameless_(American_TV_series)_characters\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d179\"},\"ref\":\"d179\",\"snippet\":\" ... Shameless (2011-2021)\\n\\nThe 11-season saga of the Gallagher family, overseen by frequently sauced single pop Frank (William H. Macy), is consistently ribald but mostly grounded thanks to smart writing and a wonderful cast of supporting players including Emmy Rossum, Jeremy Allen White, and Joan Cusack. Much ... \",\"title\":\"https://ew.com/tv/best-showtime-series/?srsltid=AfmBOope-ZKI9-YErJA7mjiYv84GJSSCOaH6O146Ow7n5iWDl_98oBF2\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d180\"},\"ref\":\"d180\",\"snippet\":\" ... Emmy Rossum\\n\\nKnown for her roles as Fiona Gallagher in the comedy-drama Shameless and Angelyne in the eponymous Peacock series, Emmy Rossum starred as Claire Addison in the DCOM Genius in 1999.\\n\\nJared Padalecki\\n\\nPrior to playing Dean Forester on Gilmore Girls and Sam Winchester on The ... \",\"title\":\"https://people.com/tv/stars-you-forgot-were-in-disney-channel-original-movies/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d181\"},\"ref\":\"d181\",\"snippet\":\" ... On the South Side of Chicago, single father Frank Gallagher (William H. Macy) struggles with his addiction to alcohol and drugs, while his six kids — Sammi (Emily Bergl), Fiona (Emmy Rossum), Lip (Jeremy Allen White), Debbie (Emma Kenney), Carl (Ethan Cutkosky), and Liam (Christian Isaiah) — and his nephew ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.netflix.com/tudum/articles/comedies-tv-shows\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d182\"},\"ref\":\"d182\",\"snippet\":\" ... Shameless\\n\\nLargely abandoned by their parents, the six Gallagher siblings are left to fend for themselves. The oldest, Fiona, struggles to keep her dysfunctional family together, aided by her siblings Lip, Ian, Debbie, Carl and even toddler Liam. The entire brood, from the youngest on up, works together ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.goldderby.com/gallery/greatest-siblings-tv-shows-ranked-brothers-sisters/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"e1b4c2c20417f3fae76798472223be0280846bef14e144e989451600cbf692f5\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"524b8c5b646f9dda63c8158efe3b61aad6637a2af65dc3931ff0c0821334fe40\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Shameless Frank Gallagher Fiona married children\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_c31b0ec3588a46f3a4a5c0ff"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the clues more carefully. The \"real-life relative plays alongside but unrelated in series\" is the most distinctive. Let me think about specific shows. The combination of \"character married 3 times, only one child survives\" with a real-life relative angle is very specific. Let me reconsider \"The 100\" — the ScreenRant article mentioned Jessica and Richard Harmon (siblings) play unrelated characters. But that doesn't fit the marriage/children clues. Let me think about shows where a real-life spouse plays an unrelated character. Let me search more specifically for the \"only one child survives\" clue combined with the marriage clue.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Outlander TV series character married three times children died one survives\", \"Outlander cast real life couple siblings co-stars unrelated characters\", \"Outlander Claire Jamie married children Faith\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_fbafe6e1acbe4d1a865249ab","index":0,"type":"function"},{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"The Blacklist TV series character married three times children died one survives\", \"The Blacklist cast real life couple siblings co-stars unrelated characters\", \"The Blacklist Raymond Reddington married children\"]}","name":"search"},"id":"call_eee5837395c64ab59e03ea27","index":1,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d183\"},\"ref\":\"d183\",\"snippet\":\" ... Outlander Character Journeys\\ndate: 2021-01-05\\n---\\nA look at Marsali MacKimmie Fraser, the latest post in a series we're calling Outlander Character Journeys.\\n\\nIn my continuing blog series exploring the journeys of key Outlander characters, I bring you the courageous, constantly pregnant, bright, stubborn, and all ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.outlandercast.com/2021/01/marsali-mackimmie-fraser.html\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d184\"},\"ref\":\"d184\",\"snippet\":\" ... When it comes to non-hetero pairings, Andre, I'm afraid no one from literature, TV or the movies holds a candle to my friends Dave and Todd. Everyone who knows them loves them, even if they aren't fictional characters on a stage.\\n\\nBlessings,\\n\\nTim\\n\\nI was ... \",\"title\":\"https://modernmrsdarcy.com/favorite-fictional-couples/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d185\"},\"ref\":\"d185\",\"snippet\":\" ... Personal life\\n\\nOn 30 June 1991, McFarlane married his wife, Kate, with whom he has three children. He divides his time between homes in Lincoln and North London.\\n\\nMcFarlane is an avid supporter of Lincoln City F.C.\\n\\nIn June 2023, McFarlane announced that he had been diagnosed ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Colin_McFarlane\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2024-10-06\\n---\\nRomance novels lend themselves to being adapted into TV shows, as their character-driven stories connect with audiences and make for compelling narratives. It's not surprising that so many of the best romantic television series are based on best-selling books consumed by a ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/best-romance-tv-shows-based-on-books/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d51\"},\"ref\":\"d51\",\"snippet\":\" ... on Outlander the book series vs. Outlander the STARZ TV show, none raises more ire than if/why Jamie Fraser gets short shrift. Holly Richter-White analyzes why TV Jamie is different than Book Jamie.\\n\\nI've had this article in the queue for a long time, as ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.outlandercast.com/2018/05/outlander-the-starz-tv-show.html\"}],\"next_ste