rs before Carrie Bradshaw made the red soles famous), set the show in a historically upper-middle-class Black neighborhood in Los Angeles, and hired black musicians as guest stars. The role model helped ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.rd.com/list/teen-tv-shows/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d53\"},\"ref\":\"d53\",\"snippet\":\" ... best couples in the show can define the story.\\n\\n3 Outlander (2014–Present)\\n\\nWritten by Diana Gabaldon\\n\\nYour comment has not been saved\\n\\nOutlander follows Claire Randall, a married nurse from 1945, who is transported back to 1743 Scotland. Amidst political intrigue and danger, she navigates life in ... \",\"title\":\"https://screenrant.com/best-romance-tv-shows-based-on-books/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d52\"},\"ref\":\"d52\",\"snippet\":\" ... We were on another Canadian series together as well, called Arctic Air, our characters didn't have a lot of interaction but more so off-camera. When we got cast (for Outlander) we had such a great time and we got to do some exploring together, it was ... \",\"title\":\"http://www.absolutemusicchat.com/music-qa-sessions/in-conversation-with-sera-lys-mcarthur-actress-outlander-arctic-air/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"a8a867ff6caad5617fa8a4545f3f3ae73a156686dc98e123985011f20152fc7d\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"12647b25edfe6786e2e7e14d917785e59da3fb51dddc89bae2363ce0900e9d02\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Outlander cast real life couple siblings co-stars unrelated characters\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not